\paragraph{Image Encoder and Decoder} Based on learnable image-level queries $\mathbf{Q}_{i} \in \mathbb{R}^{N\times K}$,  we use image encoder $\Theta$ and decoder $\Phi_{i}$ to generate image-level embeddings $\mathbf{E_i} \in \mathbb{R}^{N \times 2 \times 1 \times 1 \times K}$ for the full input image and its crop. 
